WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.860
Two explorers find a clearing
with flowers and weeds.

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.920
One says a gardener tends this plot.

3
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.050
They watch.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.880
No gardener appears.

5
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.450
They put up an electric fence
and patrol with bloodhounds.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.660
Nothing.

7
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.770
The believer says the gardener
is invisible, intangible, silent.

8
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.460
So can a belief be true if no
experiment could ever test it?

9
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.820
In this mission, you'll compare how
science and religions reach their beliefs.

10
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:32.250
Then you'll meet four ways to
relate science and religion,

11
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.600
from conflict to integration.

12
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:39.350
Your mission: find out whether a belief
that no experiment could test can still

13
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.120
be true.
